<deviceset name="WE-PMFI_353220" urn="urn:adsk.eagle:component:46964946/3" prefix="L">
<description>WE-PMFI Power Molded Flatwire Inductor

Characteristics
Very small profile molded power inductor
High range of inductance values due to inner core construction
Flat wire technology decreases RDC, starting at 4.8 mΩ
High rated current values due to low RDC, up to 16 A
Very low total losses lead to a high efficiency
Hohe Betriebstemperatur von -55°C bis +150°C
AEC-Q 200 qualified

Applications
DC/DC-converters for high current power supplies
Wearables like smartphones, tablets and cameras
CPU power supllies (IMX95)
RAM power supplies (DDR5)
Devices with low profiles and case sizes (Sensors)
Battery powered devices
High frequency devices (GaN and SiC)

Details see: www.we-online.com/en/components/products/WE-PMFI

Updated by Ella 2025-07-01
2025 (C) Würth Elektronik</description>
